F: Secunda et tertia Secreta | The second and third Secrets
L: Secunda Secreta
 = Second Secret
T: ^MISERERE, quǽsumus Dómine, fámulis et famulábus tuis, pro quibus hoc sacrifícium laudis tuæ offérimus majestáti : ut per hæc sancta, supérnæ benedictiónis grátiam obtíneant, et glóriam ætérnæ beatitúdinis acquírant. (Per Dóminum.)
 = Have mercy, we beseech You, O Lord, on Your servants and handmaids, for whom we offer this sacrifice of praise to Your majesty, that through these holy mysteries they may obtain the grace of heavenly blessing and win the glory of eternal happiness. (Through our Lord.)
L: Tertia Secreta
 = Third Secret
T: ^EXAUDI nos Deus salutáris noster : ut per hujus sacraménti virtútem a cunctis nos mentis et córporis hóstibus tueáris, grátiam tríbuens in præsénti, et glóriam in futúro. Per Dóminum.
 = Hear us, O God our Saviour, that by the power of this sacrament You may protect us from all enemies of mind and body, granting us grace in this life and glory in the life to come. Through our Lord.
F/
